The Files tile
29c-sd-tcl-the-development-tools
Starts tool.files, the page for the files of the account: the files and their indices, in one place. It runs the command exactly as the person would have typed it, so it adds no access.
Turned off, the tile is missing from this account's home screen and its menu entry cannot be chosen. The person can still type tool.files at a prompt they have; this setting only changes the home screen.
